 622+ 075F              ; Guest RAM backing access
 623+ 075F              ;
 624+ 075F              ; Guest RAM allocation starts at NeoGS physical page 44h.
 625+ 075F              ; Guest byte address maps linearly to physical offset 110000h + guest address.
