 627+ 075F              ; These routines do not restore WIN3's previous page because the page port is
 628+ 075F              ; write-only and WIN3 is owned exclusively by this memory backend.
 629+ 075F              ;
 630+ 075F              ; Entry address: x86_phys_addr = low, middle, high-nibble.
 631+ 075F              ; Read returns byte in A, carry clear. Non-RAM overlay regions return carry.
 632+ 075F              ; Write takes byte in A, carry clear on success; non-RAM returns carry.
